# Counter

The smallest complete LGX page: one field, three actions, one view.

## Page /

State:
    Let count be 0.

Actions:
    To increment:
        Set count to count + 1.

    To decrement:
        Set count to count - 1.

    To reset:
        Set count to 0.

View:
    <main class="counter">
      <h1>Counter</h1>
      <p id="count">{count}</p>
      <button id="dec" on-click={decrement}>-</button>
      <button id="inc" on-click={increment}>+</button>
      <button id="reset" on-click={reset}>reset</button>
    </main>

## Test: the count starts at zero

Expect that the text of "#count" is equal to "0".

## Test: increment and decrement each move the count by one

Click "#inc".
Click "#inc".
Expect that the text of "#count" is equal to "2".
Click "#dec".
Expect that the text of "#count" is equal to "1".

## Test: reset returns to zero from either direction

Click "#inc".
Click "#inc".
Click "#reset".
Expect that the text of "#count" is equal to "0".
Click "#dec".
Click "#dec".
Click "#reset".
Expect that the text of "#count" is equal to "0".
